WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.569 --> 00:00:14.709
stared at the mountains.

2
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.991
"A red cloud keeps appearing over those mountains," he said.

3
00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:21.312
"There must be a demon ahead."

4
00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:27.154
"The road leads right into those mountains," said the Tang Monk nervously.

5
00:00:28.155 --> 00:00:28.935
Wukong nodded.

6
00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:30.596
"We must be careful."

7
00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:34.589
He pulled out his iron bar and held it up.

8
00:00:35.889 --> 00:00:39.630
Wujing held up his spear, and Bajie held up his rake.

9
00:00:41.571 --> 00:00:43.251
The group walked cautiously.

10
00:00:45.032 --> 00:00:49.253
A red demon sat on a mountain peak, watching the travelers approach.

11
00:00:49.273 --> 00:00:55.594
"The Tang Monk has finally arrived at my mountain," the demon said to himself.

12
00:00:55.614 --> 00:01:01.036
"I've heard that eating just one bite of him will make me live forever."

13
00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.841
The demon looked at the travelers again.

14
00:01:04.861 --> 00:01:08.964
"Uh-oh. The monk's companions have their weapons out.

15
00:01:12.407 --> 00:01:14.068
probably saw my red cloud.

16
00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.930
I'll have to trick them with a disguise."

17
00:01:18.191 --> 00:01:21.293
The demon made himself look like a scared little boy.

18
00:01:23.414 --> 00:01:27.437
Then he went down to the road, sat alongside it, and waited.

19
00:01:30.099 --> 00:01:31.420
Soon the travelers approached.

20
00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:35.494
The Tang Monk saw the boy and got down from his horse.

21
00:01:39.617 --> 00:01:41.578
that's a demon," warned Wukong.

22
00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:44.280
Tang Monk scowled at the monkey.

23
00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.682
"He's just a scared little boy."

24
00:01:48.143 --> 00:01:49.524
He turned back to the boy.

25
00:01:49.544 --> 00:01:50.645
"What's wrong?"

26
00:01:52.266 --> 00:01:55.288
family was attacked by robbers," said the boy.

27
00:01:55.308 --> 00:01:57.249
"Please help me."

28
00:01:57.329 --> 00:01:59.611
"I know what you are!"

29
00:01:59.871 --> 00:02:00.752
shouted Wukong.

30
00:02:01.484 --> 00:02:02.264
"You're a demon!

31
00:02:02.585 --> 00:02:04.245
I won't let you eat the Tang Monk!"

32
00:02:05.046 --> 00:02:06.446
The boy looked horrified.

33
00:02:08.727 --> 00:02:09.668
snapped the Tang Monk.

34
00:02:09.688 --> 00:02:11.408
"You're scaring him!"

35
00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:16.471
"Master, you're being a fool again!"

36
00:02:16.791 --> 00:02:17.531
cried the monkey.

37
00:02:17.551 --> 00:02:21.933
"You always fall for demons' tricks, and you never believe me."

38
00:02:21.953 --> 00:02:25.415
"Be quiet, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

39
00:02:25.435 --> 00:02:28.516
"Or I'll recite the Tight Headband spell."

40
00:02:30.209 --> 00:02:31.870
glared angrily at the boy.

41
00:02:32.671 --> 00:02:34.152
But he didn't say another word.

42
00:02:36.354 --> 00:02:38.756
Tang Monk helped the boy to stand up.

43
00:02:38.776 --> 00:02:40.197
"Can you walk?"

44
00:02:40.617 --> 00:02:41.138
asked the monk.

45
00:02:42.139 --> 00:02:43.099
boy shook his head.

46
00:02:43.119 --> 00:02:45.181
"My leg is injured."

47
00:02:46.222 --> 00:02:48.304
The Tang Monk waved Wukong over.

48
00:02:49.365 --> 00:02:50.165
carry the boy.

49
00:02:50.906 --> 00:02:53.628
And don't be mean to him."

50
00:02:56.291 --> 00:03:00.105
The group continued west, with Wukong carrying the boy on his back.

51
00:03:02.507 --> 00:03:06.609
The monkey walked slowly, and soon his companions were far ahead.

52
00:03:06.629 --> 00:03:11.331
"You tricked the Tang Monk," said Wukong to the boy.

53
00:03:12.532 --> 00:03:13.733
you haven't tricked me.

54
00:03:13.753 --> 00:03:16.514
I know you're a demon."

55
00:03:16.614 --> 00:03:20.996
"I don't know what you're talking about," said the boy.

56
00:03:25.639 --> 00:03:30.442
A powerful wind blew, uprooting trees and almost knocking over Wukong.

57
00:03:31.642 --> 00:03:32.443
monkey laughed.

58
00:03:32.463 --> 00:03:35.664
"I know that you're making this wind blow.

59
00:03:37.085 --> 00:03:38.386
all the magic you want.

60
00:03:38.626 --> 00:03:40.207
You won't be able to blow me away.

61
00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.909
I once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

62
00:03:48.151 --> 00:03:50.252
road now ran along the edge of a cliff.

63
00:03:53.014 --> 00:03:54.034
Wukong looked down.

64
00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:57.236
"I'll throw you over the edge of this cliff," he said.

65
00:03:58.984 --> 00:04:01.125
"Then I'll just tell the Tang Monk you ran away."

66
00:04:02.025 --> 00:04:04.186
The monkey tried to grab the boy from his back.

67
00:04:04.766 --> 00:04:06.987
But at that moment, the boy disappeared.

68
00:04:08.148 --> 00:04:09.008
Wukong laughed.

69
00:04:09.948 --> 00:04:11.709
"He must have gotten scared."

70
00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.531
The wind suddenly grew stronger, and dust filled the air.

71
00:04:18.512 --> 00:04:22.133
Wukong heard screams and rushed ahead to find his friends.

72
00:04:22.153 --> 00:04:26.395
"Master!" cried the monkey, trying to see through the dust.

73
00:04:26.415 --> 00:04:28.316
"Where are you?"

74
00:04:29.972 --> 00:04:33.974
When the wind stopped, he saw Bajie and Wujing lying by the road.

75
00:04:37.616 --> 00:04:39.977
was some wind," said the pig, getting up.

76
00:04:39.997 --> 00:04:42.799
"It knocked us over," said Wujing.

77
00:04:43.599 --> 00:04:45.600
Wukong looked frantically around.

78
00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.041
"Where's Master?"

79
00:04:48.502 --> 00:04:50.023
no!" cried Bajie.

80
00:04:50.043 --> 00:04:52.244
"That boy a demon.

81
00:04:52.984 --> 00:04:54.225
He kidnapped Master!"

82
00:04:55.886 --> 00:04:56.947
Wukong shook his head.

83
00:04:58.287 --> 00:04:59.028
all go home.

84
00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:00.975
The journey is
